    "Programada": "Scheduled",
    "Programadas": "Scheduled",
    "Propone códigos y pasajes citables. No aprueba la transcripción, no juzga lo que se cuenta y no guarda nada por su cuenta.": "It proposes codes and citable passages. It does not approve the transcript, does not judge what is told and saves nothing on its own.",
